  "question": {
    "text": "The area bounded by the parabola <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> its tangent at <math><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> line <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and the <math><mi>x</mi></math>-axis is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> sq units. Then, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mi>A</mi></math> is equal to"
